# Security policy

## Reporting a vulnerability

Please do not open a public issue for a security problem. Use GitHub's private vulnerability reporting on this repository (Security tab, "Report a vulnerability"). If that is not enabled yet, contact the maintainer, {{owner}}, through their GitHub profile.

You can expect an acknowledgement within a week. A fix or a decision follows once the report is reproduced.

## Supported versions

Only the latest commit on the default branch is supported.
